artService with status Unhealthy completed after 3.434ms with message 'connection failed'\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      AddItemAsync called with userId=9844fc28-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad, productId=LS4PSXUNUM, quantity=2\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      GetCartAsync called with userId=9844fc28-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      GetCartAsync called with userId=9844fc28-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      EmptyCartAsync called with userId=9844fc28-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad\ninfo: cart.healthcheck.HealthServiceImpl[0]\n      Received health check request for service: \nfail: Microsoft.Extensions.Diagnostics.HealthChecks.DefaultHealthCheckService[103]\n      Health check oteldemo.CartService with status Unhealthy completed after 2.4524ms with message 'connection failed'\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      AddItemAsync called with userId=9a48f1d2-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad, productId=66VCHSJNUP, quantity=10\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      GetCartAsync called with userId=9a48f1d2-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      GetCartAsync called with userId=9a48f1d2-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      EmptyCartAsync called with userId=9a48f1d2-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      AddItemAsync called with userId=9c92236e-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad, productId=0PUK6V6EV0, quantity=3\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      GetCartAsync called with userId=9c92236e-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      GetCartAsync called with userId=9c92236e-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      AddItemAsync called with userId=9c98d9a2-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad, productId=L9ECAV7KIM, quantity=2\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      GetCartAsync called with userId=9c98d9a2-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      EmptyCartAsync called with userId=9c92236e-226b-11f1-afd5-067748a13dad\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      GetCartAsync called with userId=\ninfo: cart.healthcheck.HealthServiceImpl[0]\n      Received health check request for service: \nfail: Microsoft.Extensions.Diagnostics.HealthChecks.DefaultHealthCheckService[103]\n      Health check oteldemo.CartService with status Unhealthy completed after 3.2411ms with message 'connection failed'\nfail: Microsoft.Extensions.Diagnostics.HealthChecks.DefaultHealthCheckService[103]\n      Health check oteldemo.CartService with status Unhealthy completed after 4.4979ms with message 'connection failed'\ninfo: cart.healthcheck.HealthServiceImpl[0]\n      Received health check request for service: \nfail: Microsoft.Extensions.Diagnostics.HealthChecks.DefaultHealthCheckService[103]\n      Health check oteldemo.CartService with status Unhealthy completed after 4.3265ms with message 'connection failed'\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      GetCartAsync called with userId=\ninfo: cart.healthcheck.HealthServiceImpl[0]\n      Received health check request for service: \nfail: Microsoft.Extensions.Diagnostics.HealthChecks.DefaultHealthCheckService[103]\n      Health check oteldemo.CartService with status Unhealthy completed after 3.69ms with message 'connection failed'\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      GetCartAsync called with userId=\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      GetCartAsync called with userId=\ninfo: cart.cartstore.ValkeyCartStore[0]\n      GetCartAsync called with userId=\ninfo: cart.healthcheck.HealthServiceImpl[0]\n      Received health check request for service: \nfail: Microsoft.Extensions.Diagnostics.HealthChecks.DefaultHealthCheckService[103]\n      Health check oteldemo.CartService with status Unhealthy completed after 6.1436ms with message 'connection failed'\ninfo: cart.cart